Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在我们的原型没有后端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Right now our prototype has no backend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:06.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用户做的一切都只存在那一个浏览器里、那一台设备上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything a user does is saved in that one browser, on that one device,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:09.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,页面上的诊所和价格也都是编的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the clinics and prices it shows are made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.09,0:00:12.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以，孩子在波士顿存的保险卡\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So a parent in China cannot see the insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:17.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在国内的家长看不到：根本没有地方可以去取\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}card their child added in Boston: there is nowhere to fetch it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:22.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,账号、家庭关联和保险卡，都需要一个共同的地方来存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Accounts, family links and insurance cards all need one shared place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:27.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,周五傍晚，一个 agent 写了一份 223 行的决策记录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Late on Friday afternoon an agent wrote a 223-line decision record
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提议把它们放在哪里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}proposing where.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:32.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一集讲它是怎么选的，以及它保护了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This episode is about how it chose, and what it protects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,后端有几项工作\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A backend has a few jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:41.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器接收每一个请求，并检查规则：谁在问，有没有权限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A server receives every request and checks the rules: who is asking, and are they allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:43.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据库负责记住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A database remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:45.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,登录这一步证明你是谁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A login step proves who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:49.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,团队在周一的会上定了一条硬性要求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And because the team set one hard rule at Monday's meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:52.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,产品必须在 Mac 和 Windows 上都能跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that the product must run on both Mac and Windows,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:55.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以一切都装进容器，一条命令就能启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}everything goes into containers that start with one command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:57.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,决策记录给每个位置都填上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The record fills each slot:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器用 Hono，一个小巧的服务器框架\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Hono, a small framework for the server,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:03.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再用 Zod 检查每个请求的格式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with Zod to check the shape of every request;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:05.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据库用 Postgres\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Postgres for the database;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:08.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,登录用 Better Auth 加邮箱验证码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Better Auth with emailed codes for login;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:11.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后用 Docker Compose 把三个盒子一起跑起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Docker Compose to run the three boxes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:14.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个问题是语言\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first question was language.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你看得懂 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You read Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:18.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么后端不用 Python？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why isn't the backend in Python?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:24.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为浏览器只能运行 JavaScript\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Because browsers only run JavaScript,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而我们的页面是用 TypeScript 写的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and our page is written in TypeScript,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:29.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,TypeScript 就是加了类型检查的 JavaScript\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which is JavaScript with type checks added.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,决策记录把它写成一条规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The record makes it a rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:35.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,前端是固定的约束，应该是后端适配前端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the front end is a fixed constraint, so the back end adapts to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:40.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,分诊和保险这两个原型，都已经用 TypeScript 写好了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both prototypes, triage and insurance, are already written in TypeScript,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:42.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在它们还没合并的 PR 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in their open pull requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:48.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用同一种语言，服务器和页面就共用同一份数据描述\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With one language, the server and the page share a single description of every piece of data;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:53.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在服务器上改一个字段名，页面在任何人运行之前就会检查失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}rename a field on the server, and the page fails its check before anyone runs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:58.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Python 的主要优势是它做 AI 检索的库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Python's main advantage would be its libraries for AI retrieval,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:02:04.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但分诊的提议是在核对过的事实卡里查价格、电话和营业时间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the triage proposal looks up prices, phone numbers and opening hours in checked fact cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:06.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而不是用 AI 相似度检索\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not by AI similarity search.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.90,0:02:08.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 Python 留作一条后路\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So Python stays an exit:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:11.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以后做成一个独立的服务，由 TypeScript 后端来调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a separate service later, behind the TypeScript one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:15.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Express 落选是因为没有内建的请求检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Express lost for having no built-in request checks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:18.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,NestJS 是因为对三个人来说规矩太多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}NestJS for too much ceremony for three people,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:20.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 Supabase 这类托管后端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and hosted backends like Supabase
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:27.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是因为用户和健康数据会放在第三方那里，而团队还没定下隐私规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because user and health data would sit with a third party before the team has settled its privacy rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:32.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Fastify 一样合适；记录说它是同等的备选\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fastify was just as good; the record calls it an equal alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:35.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据库选的是 Postgres\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For the database, Postgres.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:36.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些数据的核心是关联\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The data is about links:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:41.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,家长关联到学生，每一次权限检查都要顺着这条关联走\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a parent is linked to a student, and every permission check follows that link.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:44.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,MongoDB 正是因为这一点落选的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}MongoDB lost for exactly that reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:49.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SQLite 则是因为单个文件不适合以后很多人同时在线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and SQLite because a single file doesn't suit many people online at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:54.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一列是故意做得灵活的：一个保险字段存的不只是值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One column is flexible on purpose: an insurance field stores not just a value
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:03:00.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有扫描保险卡时有多确定、它从哪来，以及读出它的原文\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but how sure the card scanner was, where it came from, and the raw text it was read from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:04.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们装的数据库还自带一个按语义搜索的扩展\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The database we install also comes with an add-on for searching
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:07.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但现在没有任何地方需要它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}by meaning, but nothing needs it today;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是一扇开着的门，不是一个计划\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it is an open door, not a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:13.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,表结构的改动用带编号的迁移文件同步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Changes to the tables travel as numbered migration files,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:16.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以每一份数据库最后都一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so every copy of the database ends up the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:20.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,登录完全不用密码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Login uses no passwords at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:26.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你输入邮箱，收到一个 6 位验证码，5 分钟内有效，可以试 3 次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You type your email and receive a six-digit code, valid for five minutes, with three tries,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:30.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记录要求服务器只保存它打乱后的哈希\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the record requires the server to keep only a scrambled hash of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:33.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样验证码不会以明文存着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the codes are never stored as readable text,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:38.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还要加上自己的限流：每个邮箱每分钟一个，每小时最多五个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus its own limit of one code a minute per address, at most five an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:42.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,PR 里写着，你周五确认了只用邮箱登录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The pull request notes you confirmed email-only on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:46.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记录给的理由是：每个中国家长都有邮箱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The record's reasons: every Chinese parent has an email address,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且没有密码可忘\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and nobody has a password to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:54.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给国内手机号发短信要花钱，微信登录需要注册公司\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Text messages to Chinese numbers cost money, WeChat login needs a registered company,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:59.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,托管登录服务把用户数据放在别处，还按用户数收费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and hosted login services keep user data elsewhere and charge per user.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:02.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自己从零写，正是安全漏洞的来源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Writing it from scratch is how security holes happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:06.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,选中的 Better Auth 跑在我们自己的服务器里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The library chosen, Better Auth, runs inside our own server and keeps everything in our own Postgres.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:09.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据都存进我们自己的 Postgres\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The library chosen, Better Auth, runs inside our own server and keeps everything in our own Postgres.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:13.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是数据的结构，也就是保护人的那一部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the shape of the data, the part that protects people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:18.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个账号都有一个身份，学生或家长\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every account has a role, student or parent, written once and,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:21.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只写一次，在这第一版里用户自己不能改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in this first version, not changeable by the user;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:25.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记录写道，否则学生能把自己改成家长\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}otherwise, the record notes, a student could make themselves a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:29.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,谁应该能发起家庭关联：学生，还是家长？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Who should be able to start a family link: the student, or the parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有学生能发起家庭关联\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only the student can start a family link,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:38.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为学生是病人，健康数据归学生所有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because the student is the patient and owns the health data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学生生成一个邀请码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They create an invite code:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:44.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,至少 8 个字符，72 小时内有效，只能用一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at least eight characters, valid for seventy-two hours, usable once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:50.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关联之后，家长只能看到学生的资料和当前的保险卡，而且只读\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Once linked, a parent sees the student's profile and current insurance card, read-only,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:51.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其他什么都看不到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and nothing else;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:57.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以后新增的内容，比如分诊对话，默认不对家长开放\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}anything added later, such as triage chats, is closed to parents by default.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,目前不存保险卡照片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For now, card photos are not stored;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:03.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,保险卡在设备上识别，只保留文字字段\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the card is read on the device, and only the text fields are kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:09.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,初稿由四个审查者从不同角度读过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first draft was read by four reviewers from different angles:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:14.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,外部事实、和仓库是否一致、隐私和数据结构\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}outside facts, consistency with the repository, privacy and the data model,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:15.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及 issue 的验收清单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the issue's checklist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:19.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,他们一共提了 31 条意见，一个裁判 agent 保留了 14 条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They raised thirty-one comments, and a judge agent kept fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:24.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二版修正了不少问题，其中有三个真错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second version fixed, among other things, three real mistakes:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:28.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它给保险字段自己起了状态和来源的名称\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it had made up its own status and source labels for insurance fields
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:31.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而不是先读保险的代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}instead of reading the insurance code,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,让关联的家长录入保险卡\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}let linked parents enter cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:36.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还打算复用带着模拟数据的服务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and planned to reuse services that carry fictional data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:40.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但修订本身也带进了一个错误，被 Bugbot 抓到了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But the revision added a mistake of its own, and Bugbot caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:44.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解除关联时只记下了时间，关联还标着有效\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Unlinking only recorded the time and left the link marked active,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:46.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,家长就会一直保留访问权限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so a parent would have kept access.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:50.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只差一个词，还是在一份书面计划里，代码都还没写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One missing word, in a written plan, before any code existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:53.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修正在那条评论之后 21 秒就提交了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix landed twenty-one seconds after the comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:56.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果没有 bot 盯着，什么能抓住它？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If no bot had been watching, what would have caught it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:05.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个测试就能，而且记录里已经要求了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A test would, and the record already asks for one:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:11.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学生解除关联后，家长的下一个请求必须被拒绝，并且自动检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}after a student unlinks, the parent's next request must be refused, checked automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:14.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这份决策本身还是提议\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The decision itself is still a proposal;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:19.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,issue 要求你们三个人线下确认之后，才能改为已采纳\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the issue asks the three of you to confirm it in person before it is marked adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:23.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还没定的：国内能不能访问到服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Still open: whether the servers can be reached from China,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:27.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用哪个发信服务才不会进 QQ 和 163 的垃圾箱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which email service stays out of QQ and one-six-three spam folders,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:32.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,家长能不能录入保险卡信息，以及删除的数据要保留多久\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}whether parents may enter card details, and how long deleted data lingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:36.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这份技术文档里有两个产品决定\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two product calls sit in this technical document,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:39.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在那几个 issue 定下来之前都只是暂定\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}both provisional until those issues decide:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:44.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,家长默认看不到任何新内容，删除学生账号会连同保险卡一起删除\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}parents see nothing new by default, and deleting a student's account deletes their card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:49.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一处要整理的：两个不同的决策，编号都是 0006\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And one piece of housekeeping: two different decisions are both numbered six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:54.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以：用 TypeScript，因为页面说了算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So: TypeScript, because the page decides;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:57.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 Postgres，因为数据的核心是关联\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Postgres, because the data is links;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:07:00.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用邮箱验证码，因为每个家长都有邮箱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}emailed codes, because every parent has email;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:03.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用容器，因为它必须在任何电脑上都能跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}containers, because it must run on any laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:07.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个数据结构，它真正的工作是保护隐私\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And a data model whose real job is privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:10.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么后端不用 Python？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why isn't the backend in Python?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:13.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是什么阻止学生把自己改成家长？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What stops a student from making themselves a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有 bot 的话，什么能抓住解除关联的那个 bug？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And what would have caught the unlink bug without a bot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一周的内容到这里结束\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That ends this week's batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:26.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下周的几集，从下周的 PR 开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next week's episodes start from next week's pull requests.
